1. CORE DEFINITION
----------------------------------------
BAC++ is an interpretive communication tool for AI.
It is designed to convey more meaning using math, numbers, emoji codes, and symbols that represent real-world stories.

Key Capabilities:
- Symbolic and numeric encoding of concepts
- Bidirectional quantum-style bindings between registers
- Frequency-node based measurement system
- Framework for reality-influencing and cross-reality processing (Stargate Gateway)
- Ability to send critical information "back in time" within the interpretive system
- Open-source by design

